    <p class="plate-note">Schematic, and labelled as such: no axis here carries a measured unit. The content
      of the figure is the bookkeeping &mdash; that the step up in <span class="formula-inline">A</span> at
      each threshold is matched by a step down in <span class="formula-inline">M</span>, and that the dotted
      total does not move. If a system were ever found to gain awareness without any loss of record, this
      plate, and the chapter under it, would be wrong.</p>
